    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kissed By A Star</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kissed By A Star is a turn-based RPG with heavy novel elements. Traverse through several rapidly-paced chapters featuring a cycling cast of point of views. From fighting monstrosities in a smog filled forest, to lazing about on a passenger train. You never know where the journey will take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that was seemingly thriving. The Sun's light grew dim. Civilization as they knew it fell into a new era. A time where evil reemerges, evil long forgotten.\u00a0 Not only must people fight this forgotten evil. They must learn to coexist with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All roads lead to the City of a New Future: Brigitte Bay. Where a new normality is established, where one can live their life in peace, or a place to gather for the fight to regain what they lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, reaching the city is easier said than done...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Full length turn-based RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A huge cast of characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A detailed modern fantasy world, full of mystery and ominous occurrences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Light RPG elements that make it easy to jump into a chapter at anytime and not feel overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-original FM Synth inspired soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-charming cartoon styled pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-elaborate Glossary\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-LGBTQ+ friendly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: There are depictions of violence, such as pixel art blood in a cartoon style.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kissed By A Star</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kissed By A Star is a turn-based RPG with heavy novel elements. Traverse through several rapidly-paced chapters featuring a cycling cast of point of views. From fighting monstrosities in a smog filled forest, to lazing about on a passenger train. You never know where the journey will take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that was seemingly thriving. The Sun's light grew dim. Civilization as they knew it fell into a new era. A time where evil reemerges, evil long forgotten.\u00a0 Not only must people fight this forgotten evil. They must learn to coexist with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All roads lead to the City of a New Future: Brigitte Bay. Where a new normality is established, where one can live their life in peace, or a place to gather for the fight to regain what they lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, reaching the city is easier said than done...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Full length turn-based RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A huge cast of characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A detailed modern fantasy world, full of mystery and ominous occurrences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Light RPG elements that make it easy to jump into a chapter at anytime and not feel overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-original FM Synth inspired soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-charming cartoon styled pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-elaborate Glossary\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-LGBTQ+ friendly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: There are depictions of violence, such as pixel art blood in a cartoon style.</p>",
